# Environment variables
# NOTE: .env is intentionally NOT ignored — it only contains PUBLIC Vite vars
# (VITE_SUPABASE_URL, VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY) needed at build time.
# Security relies on Supabase RLS, not on hiding these keys.
# Never commit a service_role key or any backend secret.
.env.local
.env.*.local
!.env.example

